<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Rangi Translation Project, Dodoma, Tanzania</book>
  <para style="h">Filemóoni</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant: Richard Cox</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemóoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Barʉ́wa ya Paúli kwa Filemóoni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Barʉ́wa ya Paúli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Filemóoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Mʉlongooryo</para>
  <para style="ip">Barʉ́wa ɨhɨ yaandɨkwa nɨ Paúli. Mʉʉntʉ ˆaandɨkɨrwa barʉ́wa ɨhɨ nɨ Filemóoni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1">1:1</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:21">21</ref></char>). Vamanyi va Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho vaséaa kʉʉntʉ Filemóoni ˆiikaláa, nɨ múuji wa Kolosáai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Vakolosáai 4:9</ref></char>). Kei, ʉhʉ Filemóoni nɨ musúngaati ajáa na ajáa atɨɨte vatʉ́mwa. Yeeye ajáa amuruma Yéesu na nɨ kaayii kwaachwe noo kʉʉntʉ vaantʉ ˆvamuruma Yéesu ˆvalʉmanɨráa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">1:2</ref></char>). Paúli na Filemóoni vajáa viimányire vyabooha (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:7">1:7</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:22">22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paúli aandɨka barʉ́wa ɨhɨ mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa achuungwa ʉko Róoma kati ya myaaka ya 61-62 keende Kirisitʉ ˆavyaalwa. Paúli aandɨka barʉ́wa ɨhɨ sa mʉtʉ́mwa wa Filemóoni ˆmweene akemerwáa Onésimo. Ʉhʉ mʉtʉ́mwa ajáa amʉtɨɨja Filemóoni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:18">1:18</ref></char>). Ʉko Róoma ajáa alʉmana na Paúli, na Paúli akamʉvariyʉrɨra Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu Kirisitʉ, ne akamʉvarindʉkɨra Yéesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:10">1:10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mpɨɨndɨ jira, koonɨ mʉtʉ́mwa ajáa amutíijire mweenenyuumba waachwe na akwáatirwe nɨ lamʉrɨrwa alamʉrɨrwáa ʉʉlawe. Haaha Onésimo asaakáa ahɨndʉke na kwa Filemóoni mweenenyuumba waachwe. Paúli akoona amwaandɨkɨre barʉ́wa sa adome noyo. Paúli amʉloomba Filemóoni amʉhokere Onésimo ja mwaanaavo kwa Kirisitʉ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:16">1:16</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Lʉmbɨ ya Paúli kwa Filemóoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Barʉ́wa ɨhɨ yafúmire kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ Paúli ˆnachuungwa sa <char style="w">Kirisitʉ</char> <char style="w">Yéesu</char>, na Timotéeo mwaaniitʉ. Tookwaandɨkɨra weewe Filemóoni, mʉtʉmami mwiiwiiswi, ˆtakweenda, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>na irʉʉmbʉ riitʉ Afía na Aríkipo, mʉnyaampala mwiiwiiswi. Kei tookaandɨkɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ ˆvamuruma Yéesu ˆveene valʉ́manaa kaayii kwaako. <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Nduwo na mwiikalo mʉʉja fuma kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ Taáta wiitʉ na kwa Yéesu Kirisitʉ Mweenevyoosi wiitʉ, jive na nyuunyu.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kweenda kwa Filemóoni na Kumuruma Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Kɨra siikʉ kati ˆnoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, nakʉkʉ́mbʉkɨraa na namʉdʉ́ʉmbaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa weewe. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Nɨ bweeyya niise jei, sa nateera mbuwo ja viintʉ ˆumuruma Mweenevyoosi Yéesu na ˆvyeene ʉveenda vaantʉ voosi va Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Nooloomba kuruma kwaako kʉve kɨɨntʉ kɨmwɨ na kuruma kwa vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ sa ʉtaange kukiimana kwa masáare yoosi ˆyabooha ˆmeene tapata kwa Kirisitʉ. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Mwanawiitʉ, kweenda kwaako kwaanjériirye mʉtɨma, na kwaampɨ́ɨre mʉtɨma kamwɨ, sa wavoonʼya mwerere vaantʉ va Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paúli Yooloomba sa Onésimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Sa jei, baa neembe ndɨrɨ na lʉvɨro kwa Kirisitʉ lo kʉlairirya ʉtʉmame ˆvyeene vyoosaakwa, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>maa kaa, nɨɨnɨ nɨɨ́ne nɨ viija nɨkʉloombe ko kiiyenda. Nabwéeyyiirye jei baa neembe nɨɨnɨ nɨ moosi Paúli ˆnachuungwa sa Kirisitʉ Yéesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Aaɨ nookʉloomba sa mwaana waanɨ Onésimo. Ʉhʉ, kʉnʉ kʉʉntʉ ˆnachuungwa, namʉvariyʉrɨra <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> ne aava mwaana waanɨ ko muruma Yéesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Aho ncholo Onésimo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Onésimo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ isáare ra Kɨgiríki, noo kʉsea </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ na kʉnáálo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">.</char></note> ajáa asiina kʉnáálo kwaako tʉkʉ, maa kaa, haaha, avɨ́ɨre na kʉnáálo kwaanɨ baa na kwaako.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Baa neembe namweendamweenda, nɨ kʉmʉhɨndʉla niise na kwaako. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Kwaanɨ naakeenda ngaarɨ achaale na nɨɨnɨ aha, sa aantʉmamɨre kɨpaango chaako mpɨɨndɨ nɨɨnɨ ˆnkaarɨ neékɨɨrwe nyuumbii sa Masáare Maaja. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Maa kaa, kisiina ngaarɨ ˆnabwéeyyiirye tʉkʉ bila weewe kʉʉndekera mbweeyye jeyyo. Koonɨ woosaaka kʉʉnyambirirya, nyambirirya ja ˆvyeene weewe ʉrɨ keenda, maa kaa, kʉsɨve kwa njɨra yo kʉdoomererya tʉkʉ. <verse eid="PHM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Ifaanaa ɨkava Onésimo akerwa na weewe kwa mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi sa ahɨndʉke na kwaako, wiikale ne sikʉ joosi. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Haaha, Onésimo sɨ mʉtʉ́mwa vii tʉkʉ, maa kaa, yeeye nɨ mwaaniitʉ kwa Kirisitʉ na tamweenda. Nɨɨnɨ namweenda maatʉkʉ vii, maa kaa, weewe mweenda ʉrɨ kʉlookya ja mʉtʉmami waako, kei ja mwaanaanyu kwa Mweenevyoosi.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Sa jeyyo, koonɨ wookʉʉmbɨɨka ja mwiiwaako ˆtʉtʉ́mamanʼyaa, mʉhokere ja ngaarɨ ˆvyeene wʉʉmpókɨɨre nɨɨnɨ mweeneevyo. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Koonɨ baa ahonʼya kɨmwɨ, au baa koonɨ arɨ na noongwa yaako, ndaayya nɨɨnɨ. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Nɨɨnɨ Paúli naándikire kwa mʉkono waanɨ, rɨha ndɨrɨ. Maa kaa, sɨ ndɨrɨ kuwyɨɨra weewe ʉtɨɨte noongwa yaanɨ ya nkaasʉ yaako tʉkʉ. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Mwanawiitʉ! Nyambirirya kwa Mweenevyoosi. Kei nooloomba wʉʉnjerye mʉtɨma kwa Kirisitʉ. <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Naándikire kʉnʉ nootaanga kɨkomi tʉmama ʉrɨ kʉlookya baa ayo ˆnalóombire.<verse eid="PHM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Hamwɨ na ayo, nooloomba wuunyimirye neeja haantʉ ˆnkɨɨndoojookiikala. Sa kwa kʉlʉʉsɨka kwaanyu na Mʉlʉʉngʉ, nookoona Mʉlʉʉngʉ kʉʉnchʉngʉrɨra arɨ na kʉʉja ndɨrɨ na meenyu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lʉmbɨ yo Kiimikirirya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Epáfura, akulúumbiirye. Yeeye eekerwa na nɨɨnɨ sa mʉrɨmo wa Kirisitʉ Yéesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Kei vatʉmami viiviiswi va aha, vala Maáriki, Aristáriko, Déema na Lʉ́ka vakulúumbiirye.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Nduwo ya Yéesu Kirisitʉ Mweenevyoosi ɨve na nyuunyu voosi.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
